      "cooked": "<p>For No Standard Script Report,</p>\n<p><strong>In Frappe V16 :</strong> you could freeze the columns using sticky: true</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ejaaz-khan_frappe-erpnext-opensource-activity-7301602958838763520-k0Vg/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://static.licdn.com/aero-v1/sc/h/al2o9zrvru7aqj8e1x2rzsrca\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ejaaz-khan_frappe-erpnext-opensource-activity-7301602958838763520-k0Vg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">linkedin.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/374;\"><img src=\"https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQFXPcQWtE_BEg/thumbnail-with-play-button-overlay-high/B4DZVSBIkTHkDc-/0/1740837794510?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=A5PFmNnt8MXKcdkbReoVb5FRRaLqu59I6SaY_b8ybm8\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"690\" height=\"374\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ejaaz-khan_frappe-erpnext-opensource-activity-7301602958838763520-k0Vg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How to stick columns in Frappe Reports | Ejaaz Khan posted on the topic |...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>\"Sticky columns in Reports\" in Frappe\nAfter I posted about sticky columns in the child table in Frappe, many people commented about sticky columns in reports.\nNow, you can choose which columns to stick in place, so no matter how much you scroll,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><strong>In Frappe V14 or V15</strong> : In client side you could apply CSS (position: sticky) to freeze desired columns.</p>",
